Create an API that fetches data from the public API at https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts, 
which returns an array of  objects.
 For each object, add a new key called serialNumber with an incremental value starting from 1.
 The API should support pagination, where
 the results are based on query parameters (page and perpage).
The API response should include:
The list of posts with the added serialNumber field.
The current page number.
The perpage (items per page).
The totalCount (total number of posts available).
Example API response:
{
    "data": [
        {
            "userId": 1,
            "id": 1,
            "title": "sunt aut facere repellat provident occaecati excepturi optio reprehenderit",
            "body": "quia et suscipit\nsuscipit recusandae consequuntur expedita et cum\nreprehenderit molestiae ut ut quas totam\nnostrum rerum est autem sunt rem eveniet architecto",
            "serialNumber": 1
        },
        {
            "userId": 1,
            "id": 2,
            "title": "qui est esse",
            "body": "test",
            "serialNumber": 2
        }
    ],
    "page": 1,
    "perpage": 10,
    "totalCount": 100
}
Once the data is modified (with the serialNumber added), it should also be saved to a database for future use.